WEBVTT

00:02:59.587 --> 00:03:04.590
The second story is about me, a chef.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.082
I started my training in Paris,
as a student,

00:03:08.106 --> 00:03:12.254
where I also had the good fortune
of meeting my wife, Astrid,

00:03:12.278 --> 00:03:15.712
who I convinced to come to Peru,

00:03:15.736 --> 00:03:19.423
to make our dream come true:
a small restaurant,

00:03:19.447 --> 00:03:22.951
a nice restaurant
that would support our family.

00:03:22.975 --> 00:03:24.704
This was our first restaurant:

00:03:24.728 --> 00:03:25.869
Astrid and Gastón.

00:03:25.893 --> 00:03:27.118
This was the 90s,

00:03:27.142 --> 00:03:31.810
and during the 90s -- as was happening
with cuisines across most of the world --